      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَمَنٌ قَاحِطٌ</span></b> , (K, TA,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَامٌ مُقْحِطٌ</span></b> , (TA,)
<i>A time,</i> and <i>a year, of drought; in which is no
